    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Zones v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Zones v.9. dataset consists of spatial point data with attribute information. The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Zones v8.0. The following changes were made: The data for Haut-Katanga, Haut-Lomami, Ituri, Kwango, Lomami, Maniema, and Tanganyika provinces were updated Health zone names were updated.",
